; claude: the teletype's programs, as Teletype.talk values
; (plan_terminal.md): the games of David Ahl's "101 BASIC Computer
; Games" and their kind, so that one program runs alone (a thin main,
; examples/TeletypeHangman.ml) and under TinyTerminal's shell
; (apps/system/), a command each. Tty_hangman, Tty_guess.
;
; Over the playground's Teletype, a way (its programs have no model,
; no update, no view); a private library, installed as part of
; elm_playground, pure OCaml, so every backend can run them.
(library
 (name appkit_teletype)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries elm_playground)
)
